        @V3 applies DEL/RET dispositions to affected surfaces. Mapping does not close proofs.
        Authority transfer and source-ID/semantic-owner crosswalk review passed under @D1/@O3.
        O2/@V3 proof/disposition checks, physical cleanup, and product cutover remain pending.

